@startuml seq_servicos_crud
!theme plain
actor Admin
participant UI as "FrontEnd"
participant Auth as "Auth"
participant API as "API .NET (Serviços)"
database DB as "Banco"
participant Logs as "Logs/Auditoria"

== Login ==
Admin -> UI: Acessar Painel
UI -> Auth: POST /auth/login (email, senha)
Auth -> DB: SELECT admin + valida hash
DB --> Auth: admin ok/erro
Auth --> UI: 200 {accessToken, refreshToken}\n401 inválidas
UI --> Admin: Sessão iniciada / Erro login

== Listar serviços (com token) ==
Admin -> UI: Abrir Serviços
UI -> API: GET /services\nAuthorization: Bearer token
API -> Auth: Validar token (middleware)
Auth --> API: OK/401/403
API -> DB: SELECT serviços
DB --> API: lista
API --> UI: 200 lista / 401/403
UI --> Admin: Renderizar lista

== Editar serviço ==
Admin -> UI: Salvar edição
UI -> API: PUT /services/{id}\nAuthorization + JSON
API -> Auth: Validar token
Auth --> API: OK
API -> DB: UPDATE serviço
API -> Logs: POST /logs (antes/depois)
Logs --> API: 201
API --> UI: 200 OK / 400/409
UI --> Admin: Sucesso/Erros

== Publicar/despublicar ==
Admin -> UI: Alternar publicar
UI -> API: PATCH /services/{id}/publish\nAuthorization
API -> Auth: Validar token
Auth --> API: OK
API -> DB: UPDATE statusPublicacao
API -> Logs: POST /logs
API --> UI: 200 OK / 409
UI --> Admin: Estado atualizado/Pendências

== Refresh token (opcional) ==
... token expirado ...
UI -> Auth: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
Auth -> DB: validar refresh
Auth --> UI: 200 novo accessToken / 401
@enduml
